85	 * `resolveMailbox(mailbox)`, and `resolveMailbox(undefined)` resolves the
86	 * account's DEFAULT (oldest) mailbox — not the one being read. The reading pane
87	 * used to build this href by hand and omit the parameter, so on an account with
