89	 * MEASURED, not assumed (2026-07-27, from the app host):
90	 *   openssl s_client -connect 10.20.0.10:993 -servername mail.nxeon.cloud \
91	 *     -verify_return_error   ->  CN=mail.nxeon.cloud, "Verification: OK"
92	 *   …and the same on :587 with -starttls smtp.
